      "text": "By Vieta's formulas, we have:\n$$a+b+c=-3$$\n$$ab+ac+bc=4$$\n$$(a+b)+(b+c)+(c+a)=a+b+c+a+b+c+a+b=2(a+b+c)+a+b+c=2(-(a+b+c))+-(a+b+c)=-4$$\nFrom the question, we know that $a+b+c=-3$. Substituting this into the above equation, we get:\n$$-4=-4(-3)-(-3)=12+3=15$$\nTherefore, $$t=\\boxed{-15}$$\nThe final answer is -15",
